    "evidence_text": " During an appearance on MTV RapFix, Lil Wayne announced that there will be a Big Tymers album featuring Birdman, himself, and Drake.\n\nKnockout (Lil Wayne song)\n\n\"Knockout\" is a song by Lil Wayne from his album \"Rebirth\".\n\n The song debuted at forty-four on the US \"Billboard\" Hot 100 due to strong digital sales with the album's release.\n\n This song revolves around Lil Wayne's personal relationships with a diverse group of women.\n\n The soundtrack features most of the then-roster of Cash Money Records, including Birdman, Mannie Fresh, Juvenile, B.G., Lil Wayne, and Turk.\n\nRebirth (Lil Wayne album)\nRebirth is the seventh studio album by American rapper Lil Wayne, released February 2, 2010, on Cash Money Records, Young Money Entertainment and Universal Motown.\n The album's production was primarily handled by Cool & Dre, DJ Infamous, DJ Nasty & LVM, Kevin Rudolf, and J.U.S.T.I.C.E. League.\n \"Rebirth\" was promoted as Wayne's rock music debut, though it includes some hip hop tracks.",
